Package: mediaPlanR
Type: Package
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-08-19
Title: Reliable Cross-Media Reach and Frequency Planning
Description: Reproducible tools for cross-media reach, contact-frequency
    distributions, target-audience metrics and budget allocation. Provides a
    validated media-plan data contract, exact Poisson-binomial calculations,
    Binomial, Beta-Binomial, canonical-expansion, Canonical Sequential and
    Morgensztern Sequential models, plus an explicitly scoped Negative-Binomial count approximation,
    effective-reach optimization with explicit optimality diagnostics, and
    compatibility functions for established planning workflows.
